  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If I select logout from the in game menu on one account and then log into another account without first quitting the game, the friends list breaks.  On the second account I have a much shorter friends list, but I will see thumbnails and details from friends on the first account.  Also, sometimes avatars won't load on this second account until I close the game and log back in again.  Strangely enough, this is only an issue in one direction.  The only difference I can think of is that with the first account, I log in by username, and the second I log in by email.",
